      "title": "AN INTERROGATION",
      "text": "The prisoner will not give his name or his unit. He asks only what the date is, and when he is told, he laughs. He says we are counting the wrong way."
    },
    {
      "x": 21,
      "y": 22,
      "dx": -1,
      "dy": 0,
      "title": "SCRATCHED ON A CELL WALL",
      "text": "Tally marks, hundreds of them, then: HALE. ELEVEN DAYS. THEY TAKE ONE OF US EACH NIGHT TO THE SANCTUM. THEY DO NOT COME BACK DEAD. THE BELL TOWER SENDS THE NUMBERS. STOP THE BELL AND THE COUNT STOPS. I COULD NOT."
    }
